import interface.dl

to close the writing room {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    set instance to view's instance
    close view
    close instance
    destroy the value at view
    deallocate view
    destroy the value at instance
    deallocate instance

function open the writing room using {a pointer to UI driver:driver}:
    globals:
        writing room
    execute:
        set instance to storage for one slot initialized with (an instance of writing room)
        set view to storage for one slot initialized with (a UI view of instance sized 960 by 640 using fonts "assets/fonts/NotoSans-Regular.ttf" and "assets/fonts/NotoSans-SemiBold.ttf" with driver)
        set view's close action to (the function named "close the writing room $") as a pointer
        run view
